IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-REPLAY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SESSION-TURNS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BUDGET-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FAULTS-OBSERVED     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 REPLAYED-TURNS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-REPLAY.
    IF SESSION-TURNS == 0 OR BUDGET-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 0 TO FAULTS-OBSERVED.
    MOVE SESSION-TURNS TO REPLAYED-TURNS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SESSION-TURNS.
    WEIGHT 30 REPLAYED-TURNS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
